---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PhotoStrip from "../components/PhotoStrip.astro";
import FieldPlate from "../components/FieldPlate.astro";
import Photo from "../components/Photo.astro";
import "../interior.css";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <article class="folio about">
    <header class="profile-opening">
      <div class="opening-copy">
        <span class="stamp">About me</span>
        <h1>From Naihati to Kaohsiung</h1>
        <p class="intro">
          I’m from Naihati, West Bengal, and I live in Kaohsiung, Taiwan. In
          Bengali, my name is <span lang="bn">সৌভিক ঘোষ</span>. Today my work
          spans Taiwan, China, Japan, the United States and India.
        </p>
        <div class="profile-actions">
          <a class="profile-button" href="#journey">
            Follow my journey
          </a>
          <a href="#gallery">Photo album ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <FieldPlate
        photo="writing-table"
        label="From my album"
        caption="Away from the lab, in a white kurta at a café."
      />
    </header>
    <section class="folio-row" id="journey">
      <div>
        <span class="stamp">Three milestones</span>
        <h2>How the work grew</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="journey">
        <li>
          <span class="folio-meta">2016 / Service</span>
          <p>
            I co-founded{" "}
            <a href="https://masterwithin.net/">Master Within Foundation</a>.
            Its work in education and social service is where my story as a
            founder begins.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="folio-meta">2024 / Physics</span>
          <p>
            For my master’s at Adamas University, I studied how electrons
            reflect at the junction between a metal and a superconductor.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="folio-meta">2025 / Instruments</span>
          <p>
            I commissioned <a href="/inventor/#purakaash">Purākaash Mk II</a>,
            bringing optics, tracking and software together for deep-sky imaging
            from a city rooftop.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="folio-row">
      <h2>In the lab</h2>
      <div>
        <figure class="bio-art">
          <Photo name="illustration-lab" />
          <figcaption>Illustration · In the lab</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p>
          I work on quantum computing experiments in Taiwan. In the lab, I cool
          small circuits and measure how they behave.
        </p>
        <p>
          I also work on theoretical physics, studying how electrons move
          through small structures and what happens to waves in chains with
          unusual patterns of coupling.
        </p>
        <a href="/quantum-physicist/#papers">
          Explore my research and papers →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="folio-row">
      <h2>At the writing desk</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          I write Bengali essays and articles, Hindi dohe, and verse. With Sayak
          Roy, I’m also writing a Bengali detective series set in contemporary
          Kolkata.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a content creator, I use talks, videos and essays to share work
          that would otherwise stay in a notebook or a conversation.
        </p>
        <a href="/author/">Visit my writing desk →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="folio-row" id="life">
      <h2>Where service begins</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          My Living Ideal is Sree Sree Thakur Anukulchandra. I’m a{" "}
          <span lang="bn">ঋত্বিক</span>. Through <i>Bijnan-Vibhuti</i>, I bring
          Thakur’s philosophy into conversation with modern science.
        </p>
        <p>
          That history matters to me as a founder, too. Vishwa Vigyan is a
          Master Within initiative inspired by Thakur’s vision of the Satsang
          Vishwa Vigyan Kendra. My first milestone is to change the lives of
          10,000 people. It began with helping friends and students one at a
          time.
        </p>
        <a href="/spiritual-mentor/">Read my spiritual mentorship profile →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="folio-row" id="gallery">
      <div>
        <span class="stamp">Photo album</span>
        <h2>Away from the desk</h2>
      </div>
      <PhotoStrip
        items={[
          ["telescope-mount", "Adjusting the telescope mount"],
          ["talk-whiteboard", "At the whiteboard"],
          ["portrait-kurta", "Listening, between conversations"],
        ]}
      />
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
